Addition
- [N1] Added trace (model 1): init(i1) -> action(n2,"Assess the change request") -> action(n3,"Check affected systems for business impact") -> action(n4,"Determine if change request should be approved") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n8,"Evaluate if change acceptable with more information") -> branch(b2,XOR) -> action(n9,"Reject change request due to unacceptability") -> end(e2)
- [N2] Added trace (model 3): init(i1) -> action(n2,"Assess the change request") -> action(n3,"Check affected systems for business impact") -> action(n4,"Determine if change request should be approved") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n8,"Evaluate if change acceptable with more information") -> branch(b2,XOR) -> action(n11,"Request more information from Change Coordinator") -> action(n12,"Send email enquiry to Change Coordinator") -> action(n13,"Update approval register within 3 business days") -> action(n14,"Forward email enquiry to Change Requester") -> branch(b3,XOR) -> action(n18,"Receive response from requester within 1-3 business days") -> action(n19,"Forward requester response to CAB for evaluation") -> action(n20,"Determine final approval of change request") -> branch(b4,XOR) -> action(n21,"Final approval of change request") -> action(n22,"Implement approved change") -> end(e4)